title Cassette: the record countdown at 3 over the cassette window (board CassetteCount); a tap on the panel cancels it
sizes 480x320 320x480 640x480
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO countdown
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 600
shot countdown
expect esc
expect text "RECORDING IN"
expect text "3"
expect text "tap here, STOP or Esc cancels"
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
tap "RECORDING IN"
wait 300
expect notext "RECORDING IN"
say a tap on the countdown panel cancelled it (countdown_cancel)
shot countdown-cancelled
expect noquit
